{offset205}{arialbld}Tyron Spirex{arial}

Kunduz Campaign HQ{offset0}









The latest turn of events completely changes our objectives. We've got a very loaded agenda, but let's start with the issue on everyone's mind.{pause}

{arialbld}We now know more regarding the circumstances of Major Bazuka's disappearance.{arial}{pause}

As her squadron was chasing a formation of Parano Bubka tac-bombers, the pursuit led them into the Banshir valley where a fleet of mobile flak units were awaiting them. A Fanato pilot was able to escape from the trap, undoubtedly so he could tell the story and demoralise our troops. The survivor saw with his own eyes the wings of Mayumi's Zenzen super fighter get shredded by a wall of bullets. According to him she was able to bail out by parachute.{pause}

The third piece of news comes from our infiltrated agent in Katzarin. Kharkan is settling scores with his Zirgol Padir Natkrof, whose personal ambitions are secret no more. I'm worried for Mayumi once Kharkan is finished with Padir.{pause}

{ia11}{offset105}Finally, concerning the mysterious {arialbld}Doctor Nikloz{arial} (archived photo opposite), here's some major intelligence from the mouth of a Katzar prisoner who accepted to talk on the promise of NOT being sent back to Kharkan's lines.{pause}
Here at the gates of Achkazia, rumor has it a forbidden island, in the middle of Lake {arialbld}Kalaton{arial}, sheltering an underground complex, where an insane scientist practices atrocious experiments on prisoners, from where no one has ever returned.{offset0}{pause}

This looks a lot like the ultimate goal of our mission.{pause}

To summarize the situation, we've got the choice between saving the world from Nikloz's terrifying weapons or saving Mayumi Bazuka from Fedor Kharkan's blood-stained claws.{pause}

Like my father, General Theodore Spirex used to say, {arialbld}"The simplest plan is always the best".{arial} All we have to do is multi-task!{pause} While I take care of saving the world, you will save Princess Mayumi.{pause}

If we pull this off {name}, you will a double hero: for both Normo and Fanato nations. As for me, I will be candidate for president of the Schyzo States Federation.{pause}


May the Force of Operation TSUNAMI be with you.{pause}



{offset150}{arialbld}Tyron Spirex{arial}

Vote Spirex!


